<view class="page">
  <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">鸭</view><view><view class="brand-name">上岸鸭</view><text class="brand-sub">把计划变成真正完成的事</text></view></view>
  <view class="steps"><view class="step-line active"></view><view class="step-line"></view><view class="step-line"></view></view>
  <view class="eyebrow">第 1 步 · 手机号验证</view>
  <view class="title">先绑定手机号，<br/>开启你的上岸计划</view>
  <view class="desc">使用本人常用手机号验证身份。一个手机号对应一个上岸鸭账号。</view>
  <view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><view class="input-wrap"><text class="prefix">+86</text><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入常用手机号" placeholder-class="placeholder" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone"/></view></view>
  <view class="field"><text class="field-label">短信验证码</text><view class="code-wrap"><view class="input-wrap"><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入 6 位验证码" placeholder-class="placeholder" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onCode"/></view><button class="code-btn" bindtap="sendCode" disabled="{{sending || countdown>0}}">{{countdown>0 ? countdown+' 秒后重发' : (sending?'发送中…':'获取验证码')}}</button></view></view>
  <view class="hint">验证码用于确认手机号归属，请勿向他人透露。</view>
  <view class="consent"><checkbox-group bindchange="onAgree"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#205f4b"/></checkbox-group><text>我已阅读并同意《用户服务协议》与《隐私政策》，并同意使用手机号创建账号。</text></view>
  <view class="primary" bindtap="continue">验证手机号并继续</view>
  <view class="secondary" bindtap="toLogin">已有账号？密码登录</view>
  <view class="notice">正式短信验证：验证码由服务端调用短信服务商发送，5 分钟有效。未配置真实短信通道时，系统会明确提示，绝不使用固定模拟验证码。</view>
  <view class="footer">上岸鸭 · 让每一步执行都有回音</view>
</view>